## Finish with exactly one of

- `norn done done --criteria <file> --handoff "…"` — all criteria pass (only when the worst verdict is `pass`)
- `norn done partial --criteria <file> --handoff "…"` — some criteria unverified (only when the worst verdict is `unverified`)
- `norn done blocked --handoff "…"` — cannot proceed
- `norn ask "<question>"` — you need a person's answer to continue; the step parks until answered
- `norn stuck "<reason>"` — you cannot continue; a person unblocks the step

